{"title":"驻场维护者 - Rust 程序设计语言","description":"一门帮助每个人构建可靠且高效软件的语言。","html":"<header class=\"mt3 mt2-ns mb4 mb5-ns tc tl-ns\">\n    <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n      <h1>驻场维护者</h1>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"purple pb1\">\n    <div class=\"w-100 mw-none mw-8-m mw9-l center f1 ph3\" style=\"font-size: 1.2em;\">\n      <p>\nThe Rust Foundation Maintainers Fund (RFMF) funds Rust Project contributors who maintain important parts of the Rust toolchain through the <a href=\"https://rust-lang.github.io/rfcs/3931-rfmf-rust-foundation-maintainer-fund.html\">Maintainer in Residence</a> (MiR) program. This page lists contributors who are currently funded by RFMF. <br /><br />Read more about how you can help financially support our contributors <a href=\"/funding\">here</a>.      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"green pb4\" id=\"maintainer-in-residence\">\n    <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n      <header>\n        <h2>Maintainer in Residence</h2>\n        <div class=\"highlight\"></div>\n      </header>\n      <div>\n        <p>These contributors work as full-time or part-time 驻场维护者 in the Rust Project.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n            <div class=\"person w-100 mw-50-l pr5 pb5\">\n              <div class=\"flex flex-row items-start\">\n                <a class=\"mr4 flex-shrink-0\" style=\"width: 12rem; height: 12rem;\" href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/rami3l\">\n                    <img class=\"w-100 h-100 bg-white br2\"\n                         src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/rami3l\"\n                         alt=\"rami3l\">\n                </a>\n                <div class=\"metadata\">\n                  <h3 class=\"ma0 mb2\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/rami3l\">rami3l</a>\n                  </h3>\n                  <div>Full-time Maintainer in Residence</div>\n                  <div>Maintains: <a href=\"/governance/teams#team-rustup\">rustup</a></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"description pt4\">\n                \n          rami3l has been a member of the Rustup team since 2023, and its lead since 2025. He deeply cares about developer tooling, and the facets of Rust that many might take for granted. In addition to maintaining the Rustup tool, he also introduces new contributors to the Rustup team, and has mentored two Google Summer of Code projects, in 2025 and 2026.\n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"person w-100 mw-50-l pr5 pb5\">\n              <div class=\"flex flex-row items-start\">\n                <a class=\"mr4 flex-shrink-0\" style=\"width: 12rem; height: 12rem;\" href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/ChrisDenton\">\n                    <img class=\"w-100 h-100 bg-white br2\"\n                         src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/ChrisDenton\"\n                         alt=\"ChrisDenton\">\n                </a>\n                <div class=\"metadata\">\n                  <h3 class=\"ma0 mb2\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/ChrisDenton\">Chris Denton</a>\n                  </h3>\n                  <div>Half-time Maintainer in Residence</div>\n                  <div>Maintains: <a href=\"/governance/teams#team-libs\">libs</a>, <a href=\"/governance/teams#team-compiler\">compiler</a>, <a href=\"/governance/teams#team-rustup\">rustup</a></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"description pt4\">\n                \n          Chris has deep knowledge of Windows, and provides his expertise while maintaining the standard library, the Rust compiler, and also the Rustup tool.\n                  \n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"person w-100 mw-50-l pr5 pb5\">\n              <div class=\"flex flex-row items-start\">\n                <a class=\"mr4 flex-shrink-0\" style=\"width: 12rem; height: 12rem;\" href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/blyxyas\">\n                    <img class=\"w-100 h-100 bg-white br2\"\n                         src=\"/static/images/mir/alejandra-gonzalez.jpg\"\n                         alt=\"blyxyas\">\n                </a>\n                <div class=\"metadata\">\n                  <h3 class=\"ma0 mb2\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/blyxyas\">Alejandra González</a>\n                  </h3>\n                  <div>Half-time Maintainer in Residence</div>\n                  <div>Maintains: <a href=\"/governance/teams#team-clippy\">clippy</a></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"description pt4\">\n                \n          Alejandra has been a member of the Clippy team since 2023. She focuses on improving the performance of the Clippy linter and the Rust compiler, and also reviewing pull requests in the Clippy repository. In addition, she mentors Clippy contributors.\n                  \n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"person w-100 mw-50-l pr5 pb5\">\n              <div class=\"flex flex-row items-start\">\n                <a class=\"mr4 flex-shrink-0\" style=\"width: 12rem; height: 12rem;\" href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/fmease\">\n                    <img class=\"w-100 h-100 bg-white br2\"\n                         src=\"/static/images/mir/leon-liehr.jpg\"\n                         alt=\"fmease\">\n                </a>\n                <div class=\"metadata\">\n                  <h3 class=\"ma0 mb2\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/fmease\">León Orell Valerian Liehr</a>\n                  </h3>\n                  <div>Half-time Maintainer in Residence</div>\n                  <div>Maintains: <a href=\"/governance/teams#team-rustdoc\">rustdoc</a>, <a href=\"/governance/teams#team-compiler\">compiler</a></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"description pt4\">\n                \n          León has been a member of the rustdoc team since 2023. He works on several complex long-term refactors and improvements to the Rust type system, and he is also helping out with general maintenance of the Rust compiler and the rustdoc documentation generator.\n                  \n              </div>\n            </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"red pb4\" id=\"maintainer-grant\">\n    <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n      <header>\n        <h2>Maintainer grant</h2>\n        <div class=\"highlight\"></div>\n      </header>\n      <div>\n        <p>These contributors are supported with a small monthly grant to fund their Rust maintenance work.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n            <div class=\"person w-100 mw-50-l pr5 pb5\">\n              <div class=\"flex flex-row items-start\">\n                <a class=\"mr4 flex-shrink-0\" style=\"width: 12rem; height: 12rem;\" href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/joboet\">\n                    <img class=\"w-100 h-100 bg-white br2\"\n                         src=\"/static/images/mir/jonas-boettiger.jpg\"\n                         alt=\"joboet\">\n                </a>\n                <div class=\"metadata\">\n                  <h3 class=\"ma0 mb2\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/joboet\">Jonas Böttiger</a>\n                  </h3>\n                  <div>Maintainer grant</div>\n                  <div>Maintains: <a href=\"/governance/teams#team-libs\">libs</a></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"description pt4\">\n                \n          Jonas has been a member of the libs-contributors team since 2024. He reviews changes to the Rust standard library, in areas such as data structures, synchronization primitives or platform-specific code.\n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"person w-100 mw-50-l pr5 pb5\">\n              <div class=\"flex flex-row items-start\">\n                <a class=\"mr4 flex-shrink-0\" style=\"width: 12rem; height: 12rem;\" href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/Jarcho\">\n                    <img class=\"w-100 h-100 bg-white br2\"\n                         src=\"/static/images/mir/jason-newcomb.jpg\"\n                         alt=\"Jarcho\">\n                </a>\n                <div class=\"metadata\">\n                  <h3 class=\"ma0 mb2\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.rust-lang.org/zh-CN/governance/people/Jarcho\">Jason Newcomb</a>\n                  </h3>\n                  <div>Maintainer grant</div>\n                  <div>Maintains: <a href=\"/governance/teams#team-clippy\">clippy</a></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"description pt4\">\n                \n          Jason has been a member of the Clippy team since 2022. He is performing general maintenance of the Clippy linter.\n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>"}